  <metadataclasses count="9">
    <metadataclass count="1" name="General">
      <metadata id="8428" net="1">
        <attribute name="Name" id="8429" net="1">
          <![CDATA[Medical EMR machine manufacturing (APN)]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
        <attribute name="Description" id="8430" net="1">
          <![CDATA[Ambient Petri net (Konios 2015) of the manufacture of a medical EMR machine, from the clinical order to clinical use. Users are the two devices (units) of a production batch. Step places are the sensors of the stations (scanners, testers, gates), response places the instructions the manufacturing execution system (MES) shows, database places the work orders and device records. Colour-sensitive inhibitor arcs stop a unit from moving on before the system has answered it at its current station. Failed inspections and tests send a unit back through backward steps (rework loops). After go-live the unit returns to the start (start_next_production_batch) once the MES has answered, so the net has no dead state and is reversible.
[Donwinne ambient net: {"netClass":"apn","gluing":["design_input_received","requirements_baselined","regulatory_class_assigned","risk_file_opened","hardware_design_frozen","software_design_frozen","design_reviewed","design_review_failed","bom_released","components_ordered","components_received","components_inspected","lot_rejected","components_in_stock","kit_prepared","bare_pcb_ready","solder_paste_printed","components_placed","board_soldered","board_inspected","solder_defect_found","board_tested","firmware_loaded","firmware_verified","chassis_assembled","main_board_installed","display_mounted","storage_installed","power_supply_installed","cabling_completed","enclosure_sealed","os_installed","emr_installed","database_configured","security_hardened","interfaces_configured","licence_activated","burn_in_completed","safety_tested","safety_test_failed","emc_tested","functional_tested","functional_test_failed","software_verified","dhr_compiled","qa_released","udi_labelled","packaged","shipped","installed_on_site","site_accepted","staff_trained","in_clinical_use"]}]]]>
          <graphics count="0"/>
        </attribute>
        <graphics count="0"/>
      </metadata>
    </metadataclass>
